cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "With only 4 real images of a defect class, do generated images help the classifier? A pre-registered experiment on Carinthia-S"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered experiment on Carinthia-S wafer SEM images with the public NVIDIA Cosmos AnomalyGen pipeline
  (v1.0.0): does adding few-shot generated defect images raise a classifier's recall on a defect class with only
  4 real images, and does it beat cut-and-paste controls?
